sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Atomic UI
  participant Hook as useCalculator
  participant Api as calculatorApi
  participant Ctrl as CalculatorController
  participant Core as CalculatorService
  User->>UI: 6 ÷ 3 =
  UI->>Hook: dispatch(equals)
  Hook->>Hook: validate input
  alt invalid number
    Hook-->>UI: client error
  else valid
    Hook->>Api: calculate(divide, [6, 3])
    Api->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/calculate
    Ctrl->>Ctrl: validate request
    Ctrl->>Core: execute(command)
    alt success
      Core-->>Ctrl: BigDecimal result
      Ctrl-->>Api: 200 {"result":"2"}
    else divisor is zero
      Core-->>Ctrl: DomainException
      Ctrl-->>Api: 400 ProblemDetail
    end
    Api-->>Hook: result or typed error
    Hook-->>UI: new state
  end
  UI-->>User: render display
